From: rfresh2 <89827146+rfresh2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Feb 2025 00:12:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Patch player respawn position chunk load process hang

The base logic attempts to search for a random location within the configured spawn radius

However this also assumes it can create new chunks, which in our case it can't. So this process can loop while the process hangs and the server eventually crashes.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
index f637d14b0188728192b543d7841e99a98f0c5269..73fb2c73133aae772d196d81d750e2b492366d3f 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@ public class PlayerSpawnFinder {
         this.radius = radius;
         long l = radius * 2L + 1L;
         this.candidateCount = (int)Math.min(1024L, l * l);
-        this.coprime = getCoprime(this.candidateCount);
+        this.coprime = 0; // Archive - Disable respawn pos adjustment
         this.offset = RandomSource.create().nextInt(this.candidateCount);
     }
 
